  "prefLabel": "Lab 1402.15 Entry permit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 1402.15 “Entry permit” means the written or printed document that is provided by the employer to allow and control entry into a permit space and that contains the information specified in Lab 1403.14(k).\n\nSource. #14431, eff 11-22-25, EXPIRES: 11-22-35",
